1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,932
The consequences of the decision met the council at a municipal meeting in the town hall, where every section of the public had a view.

2
00:00:07,932 --> 00:00:15,366
“This is a political question, not a type of administrative check,” the legislator said.

3
00:00:15,366 --> 00:00:22,630
“A certain number of voters will pay, and a common award of praise will not cover it.”

4
00:00:22,630 --> 00:00:35,258
The normal variety of complaints arrived within the week: a protest from the park committee, an enquiry from the retail federation, and a demonstration outside the mall.

5
00:00:35,258 --> 00:00:40,517
“We must put the plot apart from the argument,” the mayor said.

6
00:00:40,517 --> 00:00:44,921
“A brief in a pocket is not a policy.”

7
00:00:44,921 --> 00:00:53,525
The split in the council was along an unexpected line: the communist member and the fashionable liberal voted together.

8
00:00:53,525 --> 00:00:58,804
“Capitalism and communism share one thing,” she said.

9
00:00:58,804 --> 00:01:04,629
“Both of them want a compact answer to a complicated question.”

10
00:01:04,629 --> 00:01:14,967
The wedding of two staff members turned into a quiet celebration of the new rule, and a recitation of the old tariff was read aloud as a joke.

11
00:01:14,967 --> 00:01:21,056
“A spin of the same wheel will not grant us a conclusion,” the treasurer said.

12
00:01:21,056 --> 00:01:27,106
“We must enforce what we execute and execute what we enforce.”

13
00:01:27,106 --> 00:01:30,765
The claw of the prohibition was the deposit.

14
00:01:30,765 --> 00:01:42,418
“The wilderness outside the town is not ours to invade,” a resident said, and the similarity between his words and the rebel's brief was remarked on by everyone.

15
00:01:42,418 --> 00:01:46,953
“A rebellious tone is not a rebellious deed.”

16
00:01:46,953 --> 00:02:03,671
The social view of the government, the money in the market, and the right of the community to be included: the three of them were now on the same page, and the state had, for the first time, a policy it could start to defend.

17
00:02:03,671 --> 00:02:11,895
The government, the community, and the market were included in the same social view, and the law was on the right side.

18
00:02:11,895 --> 00:02:25,058
Let us put the money where the policy can start, and let the state show how it works; the public interest was not a normal interest, and the certain thing was that the town would check it.

19
00:02:25,058 --> 00:02:34,048
The municipal section of the mall was apart from the rest, and we had to do one specific thing about it.
